  "description": "Years after losing Matthew, the friend he secretly adored, retired soldier Jaden still battles lingering PTSD. Hoping to clear his head, he drops everything and sets off on an unplanned adventure. His travels lead him to a charming town where he meets Diego, a man who looks astonishingly like Matthew. At first unsettled, Jayden soon finds himself drawn to Diego’s warm, lively spirit. As they grow closer, Jayden begins to rediscover joy, laughter, and maybe even love. Could this unexpected encounter be the fresh start he’s long needed and the chance to finally heal his heart?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
